body:
@Eomm I wanted to make use of [send](https://github.com/pillarjs/send) which needs Node's Request and Response object to process. Actually, it's also being used the same way in `fastify-static`:

https://github.com/fastify/fastify-static/blob/0e48bf2d219a984b81f328c37352bf0d26fc047a/index.js#L107-L109

I also can imagine many other libraries that could be used which encapsulate the request and response processing within the library.
